    {
      "name": "dsh-plugin-pencil",
      "title": {
        "en": "Pencil design canvas",
        "pt-br": "Canvas Pencil"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Connects the Pencil app (pen.dev) over stdio MCP so the agent can read, generate and validate .pen designs in the document open in the app. The tools appear as mcp__pencil__get_app_state, get_style, read_skill, execute, browser and save. Requires Pen.app running; tool calls stay on this machine.",
        "pt-br": "Conecta o app Pencil (pen.dev) por MCP stdio para o agente ler, gerar e validar designs .pen do documento aberto no app. As tools aparecem como mcp__pencil__get_app_state, get_style, read_skill, execute, browser e save. Exige o Pen.app aberto; as chamadas ficam nesta máquina."
      },
